1
00:00:00,987 --> 00:00:04,800
Our first character is a filename with one ordinary space.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:05,851
Git accepts it.

3
00:00:05,851 --> 00:00:10,387
We edit the file, then ask the Agent Server for the list of changes.

4
00:02:03,788 --> 00:02:06,990
A single space produces a four hundred error.

5
00:02:06,990 --> 00:02:10,121
The response contains no changed-file list.

6
00:02:10,121 --> 00:02:11,757
One space, zero lists.

7
00:02:11,757 --> 00:02:15,813
Whitespace has unexpectedly been promoted to lead actor.

8
00:02:16,692 --> 00:02:21,413
This medium severity defect reproduced in two fresh verification runs.

9
00:02:21,413 --> 00:02:24,380
The recording used a third isolated server.

10
00:02:24,380 --> 00:02:27,550
Complete counts will appear in the final film.
